Do you remember?
Dianne Feinstein, has the escape departed from you?
Do you remember her answer, did you disclose the document? - 'Oh, what, what?
Oh, no. No.
The escape didn't come from me.'
Well, wait there.
The escape departed from us... No, it wasn't us," she added, imitating the senator.
Feinstein received the letter with details of the charges against Kavanaugh sent by Ford in July and the escape took place in early September, but denied that the escape had departed from his office.
